 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256850/extras/d9dd48ce68f4e9bdd3a015d7523df186.poster.avif?t=1758210988\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256850/extras/d9dd48ce68f4e9bdd3a015d7523df186.webm?t=1758210988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256850/extras/d9dd48ce68f4e9bdd3a015d7523df186.mp4?t=1758210988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique World and Characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different environments filled with unique enemies and encounters as you strive to find out what happened to your homeland. Meet a cast of quirky characters who offer assistance, information, and maybe a few surprises along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256850/extras/75ee65163e1800465f8042c918d0820d.poster.avif?t=1758210988\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256850/extras/75ee65163e1800465f8042c918d0820d.webm?t=1758210988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256850/extras/75ee65163e1800465f8042c918d0820d.mp4?t=1758210988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Roguelike Progression!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and earn rewards like new tiles and game-chang